{
  "_meta": {
    "file": "share-copy.json",
    "purpose": "分享文案模板库。5 类风格 × 多套模板，支持变量插值与轮换去重。",
    "designNote": "模板化的核心是变量丰富度。每套模板只声明结构，具体内容由用户数据填充，因此同一模板给不同用户看到的结果差异很大。",
    "lengthGuide": {
      "wechat_moments": {
        "max": 120,
        "note": "朋友圈折叠阈值约 112 字，超出会显示「全文」"
      },
      "weibo": {
        "max": 140,
        "note": "微博单条上限"
      },
      "xiaohongshu": {
        "max": 200,
        "note": "小红书正文首屏"
      },
      "short": {
        "max": 60,
        "note": "极简版，适合配图发送"
      }
    },
    "variables": {
      "archetype": "人格原型名，如「开拓型」",
      "archetypeTitle": "原型副标题，如「点子多、推得动的开拓者」",
      "animal": "MBTI 动物形象名，如「做梦小蝴蝶」",
      "mbti": "MBTI 类型码，如 INFP",
      "mbtiCn": "MBTI 中文名，如「调停者」",
      "oneLiner": "一句话概括",
      "score": "三维一致性百分比数字",
      "scoreLabel": "一致性等级，如「高度一致」",
      "rarity": "人口占比，如 1.5%",
      "topTrait": "最突出特质，如「求新好奇」",
      "topTraitVal": "该特质分值",
      "secondTrait": "第二突出特质",
      "dimCount": "填写的维度数量",
      "dimList": "维度列表，如「MBTI + 星座 + 八字」",
      "zodiac": "星座名",
      "dayMaster": "八字日主，如「庚金」",
      "strength": "首要优势描述",
      "advice": "首要建议描述",
      "conflictAxis": "分歧最大的特质轴名",
      "badge": "首个成就徽章文案",
      "traitSpan": "五维最高分与最低分之差，衡量均衡度",
      "lowTrait": "最低分特质的低端标签",
      "lowTraitVal": "最低分特质分值",
      "maxTrait": "五维最高分",
      "minTrait": "五维最低分",
      "secondTraitVal": "第二突出特质分值",
      "topAxis": "最突出特质所属轴名",
      "rarityNum": "人口占比数值版（用于条件比较）",
      "allMid": "五维是否全部落在中段"
    }
  },
  "styles": {
    "suspense": {
      "name": "悬念式",
      "icon": "🔮",
      "desc": "不直接说结论，留钩子让人想点开",
      "templates": [
        {
          "id": "sus-01",
          "text": "测完发现，我居然是「{archetype}」。\n\n{oneLiner}\n\n最意外的是三套体系居然吻合了 {score}%……",
          "needs": [
            "score"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sus-02",
          "text": "48 道题 + 星座 + 生辰八字，三方交叉验证之后，我看到了一个不太想承认但确实是我的答案。\n\n「{archetype}」",
          "needs": []
        },
        {
          "id": "sus-03",
          "text": "本来是抱着玩的心态测的。\n\n结果它说我是「{archetype}」，还说我「{topTrait}」——这个我确实没法反驳。",
          "needs": [
            "topTrait"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sus-04",
          "text": "最准的一句是这个：\n\n「{oneLiner}」\n\n不是星座，是三个维度一起算出来的。有点服。",
          "needs": []
        },
        {
          "id": "sus-05",
          "text": "全球只有 {rarity} 的人是我这一型。\n\n难怪总觉得有些话说出来别人不太懂。",
          "needs": [
            "rarity"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sus-06",
          "text": "分歧最大的居然是「{conflictAxis}」——MBTI 和星座给了我完全相反的说法。\n\n所以我到底是哪个？",
          "needs": [
            "conflictAxis"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "resonance": {
      "name": "共鸣式",
      "icon": "💭",
      "desc": "说出被说中的感受，引发同型认同",
      "templates": [
        {
          "id": "res-01",
          "text": "{mbti}「{mbtiCn}」+ {zodiac}，测出来是「{archetype}」。\n\n看到这句直接沉默了：{oneLiner}",
          "needs": [
            "zodiac",
            "mbti",
            "mbtiCn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "res-02",
          "text": "「{advice}」\n\n——这条建议，看得我有点想关掉页面。",
          "needs": [
            "advice"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "res-03",
          "text": "我是「{archetype}」，{archetypeTitle}。\n\n被说中的部分：{strength}\n不太想面对的部分：{advice}",
          "needs": [
            "strength",
            "advice"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "res-04",
          "text": "原来我不是奇怪，我是「{archetype}」。\n\n{oneLiner}\n\n有同类吗？举个手。",
          "needs": []
        },
        {
          "id": "res-05",
          "text": "{topTrait} {topTraitVal} 分。\n\n这个数字解释了我这些年很多莫名其妙的选择。",
          "needs": [
            "topTrait",
            "topTraitVal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "res-06",
          "text": "三个维度都说我「{topTrait}」。\n\n三套完全不同的体系，居然在这一点上达成了共识。那大概是真的了。",
          "needs": [
            "topTrait"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "humor": {
      "name": "幽默式",
      "icon": "😆",
      "desc": "自嘲或反差感，降低炫耀味",
      "templates": [
        {
          "id": "hum-01",
          "text": "AI 说我是「{archetype}」，形象是{animal}。\n\n我一个成年人，被概括成了一只{animal}。",
          "needs": [
            "animal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hum-02",
          "text": "花了 6 分钟做题，得到一句「{oneLiner}」\n\n钱花得值（免费的）。",
          "needs": []
        },
        {
          "id": "hum-03",
          "text": "MBTI 说我这样，星座说我那样，八字说我又是另一样。\n\n三个吵了半天，最后吻合度 {score}%。行吧，各让一步。",
          "needs": [
            "score"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hum-04",
          "text": "优势：{strength}\n建议：{advice}\n\n翻译一下就是——继续这样，但别太这样。",
          "needs": [
            "strength",
            "advice"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hum-05",
          "text": "测出来是「{archetype}」，配图是只{animal}。\n\n本来想反驳，看了一眼那个表情，确实挺像我上班时候的样子。",
          "needs": [
            "animal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hum-06",
          "text": "它说我{topTrait}（{topTraitVal}分）。\n\n分数这么高，是不是该找个地方兑换点什么。",
          "needs": [
            "topTrait",
            "topTraitVal"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "flex": {
      "name": "成就炫耀式",
      "icon": "🏆",
      "desc": "突出稀有度与数据亮点",
      "templates": [
        {
          "id": "flx-01",
          "text": "🏆 {badge}\n\n人格原型「{archetype}」— {archetypeTitle}\n三维吻合度 {score}%（{scoreLabel}）",
          "needs": [
            "badge",
            "score",
            "scoreLabel"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "flx-02",
          "text": "{mbti} · 全球仅 {rarity}\n\n「{archetype}」{archetypeTitle}\n\n稀有度这块我先站个位。",
          "needs": [
            "rarity",
            "mbti"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "flx-03",
          "text": "MBTI + 星座 + 八字，三套体系交叉验证：吻合度 {score}%，{scoreLabel}。\n\n我这个人，还挺自洽的。",
          "needs": [
            "score",
            "scoreLabel"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "flx-04",
          "text": "{topTrait} {topTraitVal} · {secondTrait}\n\n「{archetype}」认证完毕。",
          "needs": [
            "topTrait",
            "topTraitVal",
            "secondTrait"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "flx-05",
          "text": "完整版三维报告已解锁 ✅\n{dimList}\n\n结论：「{archetype}」，{oneLiner}",
          "needs": [
            "dimList"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "minimal": {
      "name": "极简式",
      "icon": "◾",
      "desc": "配图发送，文字只做点题",
      "templates": [
        {
          "id": "min-01",
          "text": "「{archetype}」\n{oneLiner}",
          "needs": []
        },
        {
          "id": "min-02",
          "text": "{mbti} · {archetype}\n三维吻合度 {score}%",
          "needs": [
            "score",
            "mbti"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "min-03",
          "text": "{oneLiner}",
          "needs": []
        },
        {
          "id": "min-04",
          "text": "我是一只{animal}。\n（认证过的）",
          "needs": [
            "animal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "min-05",
          "text": "{topTrait}、{secondTrait}。\n\n就这两个词，概括了我。",
          "needs": [
            "topTrait",
            "secondTrait"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "cta": {
    "_note": "结尾引导语。{url} 会被替换为 site.url。short 列表用于长文案兜底，确保链接不被丢弃。",
    "list": [
      "你是哪一型？👉 {url}",
      "来测测看你是什么 👉 {url}",
      "好奇你们的结果 👉 {url}",
      "评论区报个型？👉 {url}",
      "三维交叉分析，比单看星座准 👉 {url}",
      "48 题量表 + 星座 + 八字 👉 {url}"
    ],
    "short": [
      "👉 {url}",
      "测测你的 👉 {url}"
    ]
  },
  "badges": {
    "_note": "成就徽章。按条件动态解锁，用于分享图与炫耀式文案。",
    "rules": [
      {
        "id": "ultra-rare",
        "cond": "rarity<2",
        "icon": "💎",
        "label": "极稀有人格",
        "sub": "全球仅 {rarity}",
        "color": "#C4A9F5",
        "weight": 100
      },
      {
        "id": "rare",
        "cond": "rarity<4",
        "icon": "✨",
        "label": "稀有人格",
        "sub": "全球仅 {rarity}",
        "color": "#8FC9F5",
        "weight": 90
      },
      {
        "id": "perfect-sync",
        "cond": "score>=85",
        "icon": "🎯",
        "label": "三观高度统一",
        "sub": "吻合度 {score}%",
        "color": "#3FB98C",
        "weight": 95
      },
      {
        "id": "high-sync",
        "cond": "score>=70",
        "icon": "🔗",
        "label": "三维吻合",
        "sub": "吻合度 {score}%",
        "color": "#7DDCC0",
        "weight": 70
      },
      {
        "id": "split-soul",
        "cond": "score<45",
        "icon": "🎭",
        "label": "多面人格",
        "sub": "三套体系分歧明显",
        "color": "#EA7BA8",
        "weight": 85
      },
      {
        "id": "extreme-trait",
        "cond": "maxTrait>=76",
        "icon": "🔥",
        "label": "{topTrait}拉满",
        "sub": "{topTraitVal} 分",
        "color": "#FF8A6B",
        "weight": 88
      },
      {
        "id": "rare-low",
        "cond": "minTrait<=34",
        "icon": "🧊",
        "label": "极致{lowTrait}",
        "sub": "仅 {lowTraitVal} 分",
        "color": "#8FC9F5",
        "weight": 80
      },
      {
        "id": "full-report",
        "cond": "dimCount==3",
        "icon": "🏅",
        "label": "完整版报告",
        "sub": "三维全解析",
        "color": "#FFD84D",
        "weight": 60
      },
      {
        "id": "balanced",
        "cond": "traitSpan<=28",
        "icon": "⚖️",
        "label": "罕见均衡型",
        "sub": "五维差异极小",
        "color": "#C9C4D2",
        "weight": 82
      }
    ]
  },
